

# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          (≤ 100 chars, imperative, lower-case, no period)
#
# <body>                              (what and why, not how; wrap at 120)
#
# <footer>                            BREAKING CHANGE: ..., Closes #123
#
# type:   feat | fix | perf | refactor | docs | test | build | ci | chore | style | revert
# scope:  vue | nuxt | core | hints | position | components | docs | playground | release | deps | lint
#
# Examples:
#   feat(components): showArrow option on config, step and hints
#   fix(hints): beacons follow the page scroll natively
#   docs(playground): multi-page tour with useMultiPageTour
#
# A user-facing change to a package also needs a changeset:  pnpm changeset
